I put the machine into hibernate by closing the lid. When I reactivated
it, the screen flashed once then went dark. I ssh'd from another machine
and grabbed dmesg, attached, It's been about ten minutes and the screen
is still dark and inert. I restarted gdm from my shell and poof, got a
login screeen. Oddly, when I log in, it displays the desktop for a
moment them locks the screen. Let me know if dmesg tells you anything,
it does not me. By the way, I'm running fedora Desktop which I believe
is gnome-shell, as you mentioned.

73 | *KB3KEY* | John | Mt.Airy,MD
